            "prompt": "Complete FULLY OPAQUE portrait4:5 storybook illustration, target1280x1600. Every pixel naturally painted/opaque alpha255, no transparent edges or alpha. Cozy dimensional softly brushed premium mobile puzzle art, detailed warm natural materials, coherent upperleft sunlight and realistic object relationships. No text, brands, labels, landmarks, people,UI,frame,watermark. Complete clean background for five later parts, noholes. A cottagepottingroom with lovelyclaypots andwell-keptgardeningtools, gentlyelevatedthreequarterview. COCOA BROWN dominatesweatheredwoodenworktable, rearwoodwall andlarge storagecubbies; creamjarsandquietgreenplants asaccents. Windowleftupperwithbaremetalrod andnocurtain, foliageoutside. Aplantpotrearupperrightx84%,y35% hasbare shortstem. A tinyemptynarrowclaybudvase atfrontcenterx50%,y74%. A simpleclothtoolroll lowerrightx74%,y80% is tiedwithplaincord no bow. Smallleftwallpegnearx29%,y44% bare. Laterdetailsomitted: shortivorywindowcurtain, rootedfernfrondinpot, smallwhiteflowerinvase, thincreamcottonbow ontoolroll, softsageclothstriponpeg. Soilmarksandgrainpaintednaturally.",
